BT /F2 18 Tf 54 744 Td (SQL Joins Explained) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 707 Td (Subject: Database Management Systems Topic: SQL) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 679 Td (Overview) Tj ET
